  "details": "Right now, in VR, looking down will make the IK think the head is raised up and the character will stand on their toes (if they have the bone assigned). \nThis makes for some really awkward situations and I've seen my share of avatars that are on their toes practically all the time. \nI personally chose to remove the toe bones on my avatars for that reason and it's annoying because it's such a cute effect.",
